<title>COLOMBIA: Colombia's April oil exports at 6.27 mln barrels.</title>
<headline>Colombia's April oil exports at 6.27 mln barrels.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombia's state oil company Ecopetrol exported 6.27 million barrels of crude in April, down from 7.5 million barrels in March, the company said in a statement Wednesday.</p>
<p>Ecopetrol's oil revenues totaled $109.6 million compared to $135.5 million a month earlier.</p>
<p>Ecopetrol imported about 694,000 barrels of gasoline at a cost of $18.9 million in April to cover the domestic shortfall, compared to 600,000 barrels of gasoline imports in March.</p>
<p>((-- Karl Penhaul, Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944))</p>
